t four floors of a surprisingly spacious basement (n.b. Basement access NOT recommended).Meet up with co-tenants Blake and Rory to vie","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T15:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381670","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3557870-1842846814455938","game_id":"steam-3557870","kind":"announcement","title":"Don’t Go Into the Basement - Bad House Launches Early 2027","summary":"We’re proud to present a spacious and immaculately presented dungeon-crawler auto-battler, coming to the market in early 2027! Perfect for first-time dungeon crawlers, Bad House also offers tenants an opportunity to preview the property - with a demo coming soon.The property (which is made from standard building materials and not from blood and bones) offers unique, persistent storage, with partial furnishings and resources left by the previous tenant.If tenants do venture into the basement (not","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T15:01:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455938","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3557870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3557870":"2026-10-26T00:41:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3557870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5058480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3557